# Build needs: app/, components/, lib/, data/, public/, scripts/, config files,
# and drafts/outreach/ (the unlinked /gifts founder-review page reads it at build
# time — lib/gifts.ts). Everything below is repo-only and never used by `next build`:
pipeline/cache/
docs/
mcp/
.superpowers/
.github/
*.md
!README.md
!drafts/outreach/*.md
!drafts/outreach/**/*.md
# `*.md` also matches the llms.md ROUTE DIRECTORIES (app/**/llms.md/route.ts) and the
# reports/*.md the /reports page reads at build time — both must reach the upload.
!app/**/llms.md/
!reports/*.md
!reports/**/*.md
